    <page>
        <p component="b" workspace="5in">
            What about the other trigonometric functions? How do these relate to <m>\sin(x)</m> and <m>\cos(x)</m>?
        </p>
        <p component="a">
            What about the other trigonometric functions? How do these relate to <m>sin(x)</m> and <m>\cos(x)</m>? They are all just quotients, so we can use the quotient rule. The resulting formulas are...
