    <page>
        <example workspace="2in">
            <introduction>
                <p>
                    Assume that a mass attached to a spring which is pulled down by <quantity><mag>3</mag><unit prefix="centi" base="meter"/></quantity> and released has position given by the function <m>x(t) = 3\sin(2t)</m>. In this system, <m>x=0</m> is the rest position of the mass.
                </p>
            </introduction>
            <task>
                <statement>
                    <p>
                        Compute the velocity and acceleration of this mass at any time <m>t</m>.
                    </p>
                </statement>
        
            </task>
            <task>
                <statement>
                    <p>
                        What is the maximum velocity of this mass, when does it occur, and where is the mass when this happens?
                    </p>
                </statement>
            </task>
            <task>
                <statement>
                    <p>
